# Project Overview

Before editing this repository, read:

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `docs/development/engineering-standards.md`
3. `docs/development/ui-implementation-rules.md`
4. `docs/development/ai-collaboration-rules.md`
5. `docs/development/current-architecture.md`

This is an AI-assisted long-form novel writing workbench centered on an automatic-writing cockpit, not a generic chatbot. AI writes only inside an explicitly started run and must use the change-set and risk-decision pipeline.

Always keep the repository buildable. Run `pnpm check` before claiming completion.
